## Expense Reporting

### Submission Requirements

| Requirement | Standard |
|-------------|----------|
| Submission Deadline | 30 days after travel |
| Receipts Required | All expenses >$25 |
| Approval | Manager within 7 days |
| Reimbursement | Direct deposit within 14 days |

### Required Documentation

| Expense Type | Documentation |
|--------------|---------------|
| Airfare | Itinerary + receipt |
| Hotel | Itemized folio |
| Meals | Receipt + attendees |
| Entertainment | Receipt + attendees + business purpose |
| Rental Car | Receipt + fuel receipts |
| Other | Receipt + business purpose |

---

## Non-Reimbursable Expenses

- Personal travel or extensions
- First-class upgrades (unless approved)
- Spouse/family travel
- Personal entertainment
- Traffic violations or parking tickets
- Lost/stolen items
- Personal phone calls (reasonable exceptions)
- Alcohol (excessive)
- In-room movies
- Gym fees (unless medically required)
- Laundry (<5 days travel)

---

## Corporate Card

### Usage Requirements

| Requirement | Standard |
|-------------|----------|
| Eligibility | Employees who travel 4+/year |
| Personal Use | Not permitted |
| Payment | Auto-debit from payroll |
| Limit | Per employee level |
| Lost/Stolen | Report immediately |

### Card Limits

| Level | Monthly Limit |
|-------|---------------|
| Individual Contributor | $5,000 |
| Manager | $10,000 |
| Director | $15,000 |
| VP+ | $25,000 |

---

## Policy Violations

| Violation | Consequence |
|-----------|-------------|
| Late Submission | Reimbursement delay |
| Missing Receipts | Expense not reimbursed |
| Personal Expenses | Repayment required |
| Fraud | Termination + legal action |
| Repeated Violations | Card revocation |

---

## Exceptions

Exception requests must be submitted in writing to:
- Manager: <$500 variance
- Director: $500-$1,500 variance
- VP: >$1,500 variance
- CFO: Policy exceptions

